          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: குடியுங்கள்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குடியுங்கள் (kuṭiyuṅkaḷ) — \"please drink\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தண்ணீர் குடியுங்கள் (kuṭiyuṅkaḷ) — \"please have some water\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Look at தண்ணீர்: it is the thing being drunk, and it carries no -ஐ. A thing can do without the ending that a person must have."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Food, and now drink."
            }
          ]
        },
